# Tray widget fixture only; keep ASAN_OPTIONS=detect_leaks=1.
# After releasing Pango's default map, Fontconfig 2.15.0 retains 320 bytes
# in three XML initialization allocations whose stacks contain FcInit.
# Evidence: pc_a84bd16ecea1. --lsan-negative-control must still report
# inject_owned_leak_for_sanitizer_negative_control (73 bytes, one allocation).
leak:FcInit
